    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, i don't think i want to find \"meaningful connections.\" i've spent my whole life chasing this one thing, and now that it's here, the silence is just deafening. i feel like i've finished the book and there are no more chapters. what am i supposed to do when the purpose is gone?",
