      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't want to write more chapters. i'm just so tired. i feel like i've reached the logical end of the story. everything that mattered is done, and there's just this heavy, dark nothingness left. it feels more like an ending than a pause. doesn't it feel weird that once you reach the summit, there's nowhere left to go but down?",
